7f3-b42a-40aacf8db2d5\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Left by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mizora\" title=\"Mizora\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/77/Portrait_Mizora.png/25px-Portrait_Mizora.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/77/Portrait_Mizora.png/38px-Portrait_Mizora.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/77/Portrait_Mizora.png/50px-Portrait_Mizora.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mizora\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/77/Portrait_Mizora.png/25px-Portrait_Mizora.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/77/Portrait_Mizora.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mizora\" title=\"Mizora\">Mizora</a> in camp if <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wyll\" title=\"Wyll\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png/25px-Portrait_Wyll.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png/38px-Portrait_Wyll.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png/50px-Portrait_Wyll.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wyll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png/25px-Portrait_Wyll.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wyll\" title=\"Wyll\">Wyll</a> leaves</li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<dl><dd><i>If <a href=\"/wiki/Wyll\" title=\"Wyll\">Wyll</a> broke his pact</i> (<details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">S_EPI_Letter_AlfiraAndLakrissa</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_EPI_Letter_AlfiraAndLakrissa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_EPI_Letter_AlfiraAndLakrissa\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> / <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">a8151237-1ba8-43de-a712-76de13565e73</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:a8151237-1ba8-43de-a712-76de13565e73\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:a8151237-1ba8-43de-a712-76de13565e73\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>):</dd></dl>\n<p><br>\nWhy you little stinker. Good thing I plan for all eventualities - including the <a href=\"/wiki/Wyll\" title=\"Wyll\">pup's</a> untimely exit. That's the thing about <a href=\"/wiki/Devil\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Devil\">devils</a>: when someone goes knotting things up, we work out the kinks. (Yes, I'm only <a href=\"/wiki/Cambion\" title=\"Cambion\">half-devil</a>, but let's not quibble over details, dumpling.)\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Suffice to say, plans have changed. I could've just flitted off without leaving a messgae, but I could NEVER be so rude - why, you were twice as fun as a pail of de-winged imps, and not near so ugly.\n</p><p><br>\nMizora\n</p><p><br>\n</p>\n<dl><dd><i>If <a href=\"/wiki/Wyll\" title=\"Wyll\">Wyll</a> kept his pact</i> (<details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">S_ORI_Wyll_WyllLeavesTeam_MizoraNotePactKept</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_ORI_Wyll_WyllLeavesTeam_MizoraNotePactKept\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_ORI_Wyll_WyllLeavesTeam_MizoraNotePactKept\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> / <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">bb5b1633-353a-47f3-b42a-40aacf8db2d5</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:bb5b1633-353a-47f3-b42a-40aacf8db2d5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:bb5b1633-353a-47f3-b42a-40aacf8db2d5\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>):</dd></dl>\n<p><br>\nWhy you little stinker. Good thing I plan for all eventualities - including the <a href=\"/wiki/Wyll\" title=\"Wyll\">pup's</a> untimely exit. That's the thing about <a href=\"/wiki/Devil\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Devil\">devils</a>: when someone goes knotting things up, we work out the kinks. (Yes, I'm only <a href=\"/wiki/Cambion\" title=\"Cambion\">half-devil</a>, but let's not quibble over details, dumpling.)\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Suffice to say, plans have changed. I could've just flitted off without leaving a messgae, but I could NEVER be so rude - why, you were twice as fun as a pail of de-winged imps, and not near so ugly.\n</p><p><br>\nMizora\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>P.S. You haven't seen the last of me. When time comes to squash that big bad brain, I'll be a whistle away. Ta-ta!\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>When dropped, the note is in a fire.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714222933\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.071 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.074 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2746/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 63851/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 21268/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.016/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1205383/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   57.995      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   57.995      1 -total\n 53.33%   30.931     10 Template:Icon_text\n 48.44%   28.093     29 Template:Trim\n 34.22%   19.848      8 Template:Uid\n 14.26%    8.272      4 Template:Icon_link\n 13.12%    7.606      8 Template:Template_style\n 12.51%    7.256      4 Template:Uuid\n 11.32%    6.566      1 Template:Main_only\n 10.72%    6.218      8 Template:NorbyteLink\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:53420-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714222933 and revision id 328984. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}